<title>KUWAIT: Perry arrives in Kuwait from Saudi-agency.</title>
<headline>Perry arrives in Kuwait from Saudi-agency.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defence Secretary William Perry arrived in Kuwait from Saudi Arabia on Sunday to discuss the situation in the Gulf region, state-owned Kuwait News Agency reported.</p>
</text>
